WEBVTT

01:31.500 --> 01:32.256
=Blossoms of Power=

01:32.256 --> 01:35.140
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

01:35.140 --> 01:38.100
=Episode 17=

01:38.160 --> 01:41.456
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

01:41.536 --> 01:43.300
Father, you've only
been here for three days.

01:43.319 --> 01:44.400
And you're leaving again.

01:47.040 --> 01:48.480
Things can change in an instant

01:48.799 --> 01:49.959
on the battlefield.

01:50.599 --> 01:51.799
There's not a moment to waste.

01:57.040 --> 01:58.230
Let me help you put this on.

02:14.000 --> 02:15.319
I made this

02:15.479 --> 02:16.639
silver fox cloak myself.

02:17.072 --> 02:18.848
The journey ahead will be bitterly cold.

02:18.896 --> 02:20.190
Use it to keep yourself warm.

02:22.240 --> 02:23.919
With such a wonderful daughter,

02:24.352 --> 02:26.400
I'll be sure to find you
an excellent husband.

02:28.639 --> 02:31.280
The Crown Prince is truly fortunate.

02:31.719 --> 02:33.719
I haven't even had the chance
to test his skills,

02:33.919 --> 02:35.039
and now I have to leave.

02:36.080 --> 02:36.960
Tell him

02:37.520 --> 02:38.520
this isn't over yet.

02:44.360 --> 02:45.280
My good daughter,

02:45.759 --> 02:47.039
once I've won this battle,

02:47.280 --> 02:48.560
I'll send you the good news.

02:49.120 --> 02:50.039
Take care, Father.

03:19.260 --> 03:21.060
(Shen)

03:30.960 --> 03:32.319
Archers, fire!

03:37.632 --> 03:38.560
Raise your shields!

03:38.560 --> 03:39.319
Form ranks!

03:39.479 --> 03:40.159
- Yes!
- Yes!

03:40.520 --> 03:41.599
- Hurry!
- Hurry!

03:56.280 --> 03:56.800
Fire!

04:08.840 --> 04:10.759
Duke, the arrows are poisoned!

04:13.879 --> 04:14.960
Hold the formation!

04:15.400 --> 04:16.480
I'll lead the charge!

04:16.600 --> 04:17.879
Duke, you mustn't!

04:17.879 --> 04:18.600
You mustn't!

04:18.600 --> 04:20.319
Are you going to disobey my orders?

04:20.319 --> 04:20.959
Move aside!

04:20.959 --> 04:22.680
Duke, you are marching to your death!

04:22.680 --> 04:24.540
If you go, we'll spill
our blood here and now!

04:24.550 --> 04:27.540
- We'll spill our blood here and now!
- We'll spill our blood here and now!

04:51.000 --> 04:53.639
- Protect the Crown Prince!
- Protect the Crown Prince!

04:55.399 --> 04:55.920
Duke!

04:56.199 --> 04:57.839
I am here to escort you.

04:58.080 --> 04:59.800
They're nothing but Northern Di cowards.

04:59.840 --> 05:02.160
There was no need
for Your Highness to come in person.

05:03.199 --> 05:04.439
I've come today

05:04.496 --> 05:06.736
to make good on the promise
I made that day.

05:11.279 --> 05:11.959
Good!

05:12.600 --> 05:14.519
Let me see whether Your Highness

05:14.959 --> 05:16.399
is worthy of becoming my son-in-law.

05:17.399 --> 05:18.600
Charge!

05:32.279 --> 05:33.160
Fire!

05:43.160 --> 05:44.279
- Charge!
- Charge!

07:41.536 --> 07:44.016
You led the charge
and broke through the enemy ranks alone.

07:44.360 --> 07:45.160
I truly admire you.

07:46.600 --> 07:47.560
Your Highness,

07:48.040 --> 07:49.120
you've got some real skill.

07:58.879 --> 08:00.199
To be honest,

08:00.199 --> 08:02.560
I wasn't too pleased
with Your Highness before.

08:02.839 --> 08:04.000
But today,

08:04.000 --> 08:06.480
I've seen your
martial skill and courage.

08:07.759 --> 08:08.879
I have nothing more to say.

08:10.399 --> 08:12.240
But when it comes to Xihe,

08:12.600 --> 08:13.920
you're so determined.

08:13.920 --> 08:15.720
Is it because she
agreed to this marriage,

08:15.720 --> 08:17.560
only to have the wedding postponed,

08:17.560 --> 08:18.920
and you couldn't let it go?

08:19.079 --> 08:20.079
My feelings for Xihe

08:20.144 --> 08:22.320
have nothing to do
with a man's desire to conquer.

08:22.600 --> 08:25.160
I sincerely wish to spend
the rest of my life with her.

08:27.319 --> 08:29.519
Your Highness came here in person today

08:29.759 --> 08:31.000
and risked your life to help me.

08:31.680 --> 08:32.559
I believe

08:33.039 --> 08:33.720
your sincerity.

08:34.639 --> 08:35.559
But a person's heart...

08:39.039 --> 08:40.120
How can you promise

08:40.320 --> 08:42.279
that you'll always remain true to Xihe?

08:45.440 --> 08:47.519
If I stood here and swore to you

08:48.800 --> 08:50.320
that my heart would never change

08:50.416 --> 08:51.630
and I'd never regret my love,

08:52.048 --> 08:53.600
I'm sure you wouldn't believe me.

08:53.840 --> 08:54.440
I wouldn't.

08:57.559 --> 08:58.559
The truth is,

09:00.159 --> 09:01.240
I don't even know why.

09:03.840 --> 09:05.279
I only know I've fallen for her.

09:06.720 --> 09:07.759
I can't control myself.

09:09.840 --> 09:10.720
I can't break free.

09:18.399 --> 09:19.600
"I've fallen for her.

09:20.799 --> 09:24.080
I can't control myself.
I can't break free."

09:24.759 --> 09:26.080
Those words

09:28.919 --> 09:29.799
somehow

09:30.799 --> 09:32.320
sound even more sincere.

09:36.360 --> 09:37.240
To be honest, Duke,

09:37.360 --> 09:38.639
even now,

09:38.704 --> 09:40.752
I still haven't won
the Commandery Princess' heart.

09:42.720 --> 09:44.672
The Commandery Princess
postponed the wedding

09:45.000 --> 09:47.200
because she still has doubts
about this marriage.

09:49.600 --> 09:51.240
You're certainly honest.

09:51.240 --> 09:52.159
But I know

09:53.159 --> 09:54.519
when two strong-willed people

09:55.200 --> 09:56.360
truly choose each other,

09:56.879 --> 09:57.799
their love

09:58.159 --> 09:59.279
will never waver.

09:59.720 --> 10:01.240
Your Highness,

10:02.399 --> 10:05.639
it won't be easy to melt
my precious daughter Xihe's

10:06.039 --> 10:06.919
icy heart.

10:07.679 --> 10:09.440
So I advise Your Highness

10:09.879 --> 10:11.200
to walk away while you still can.

10:13.184 --> 10:14.720
I won't back down even half a step.

10:16.240 --> 10:17.120
With perseverance,

10:17.504 --> 10:19.200
even metal and stone can be carved.

10:35.000 --> 10:35.879
Finish it,

10:37.480 --> 10:39.240
and I'll never oppose
the two of you again.

10:39.399 --> 10:40.120
But

10:40.759 --> 10:42.320
to win Xihe's heart,

10:42.320 --> 10:43.840
you must rely on your own abilities.

10:44.000 --> 10:45.799
I won't say another word.

10:48.840 --> 10:49.960
Thank you, Father-in-law.

10:51.072 --> 10:52.440
You're not even married yet.

10:52.799 --> 10:54.399
And in front of all these people,

10:54.919 --> 10:56.279
you called me Father-in-law?

10:56.600 --> 10:58.120
Calling you Father-in-law

10:58.208 --> 10:59.456
is my way of winning you over.

10:59.559 --> 11:02.440
It's only right for a son-in-law
to win over his father-in-law.

11:03.279 --> 11:04.120
Father-in-law,

11:04.440 --> 11:05.600
I'll drink to you first!

11:06.919 --> 11:11.840
- Good!
- Good!

11:19.240 --> 11:20.440
Excellent.

11:21.120 --> 11:21.720
Good.

11:23.679 --> 11:24.759
Men,

11:25.200 --> 11:25.919
raise your cups!

11:27.320 --> 11:28.000
Come, drink!

11:28.360 --> 11:30.600
- Come!
- Come!

11:31.000 --> 11:31.840
Together!

11:32.399 --> 11:33.080
Bottoms up!

11:33.080 --> 11:35.639
- Drink!
- Drink!

11:35.639 --> 11:36.080
Drink!

11:36.279 --> 11:39.039
- Congratulations, Duke.
- Congratulations, Duke.

11:44.159 --> 11:46.840
His Majesty and Her Majesty
really dote on you.

11:46.880 --> 11:48.336
Every time you come to pay respects,

11:48.384 --> 11:50.200
they beam with joy
the moment they see you.

11:50.544 --> 11:52.750
Crown Prince wasn't in
the palace the past few days.

11:52.879 --> 11:54.360
Do you know what he went to do?

11:54.544 --> 11:56.670
I have no interest in
inquiring about his business.

11:57.440 --> 11:59.759
The Crown Prince went
to catch up with the Duke.

12:02.320 --> 12:03.799
Why did he go after my father?

12:04.639 --> 12:07.159
The scoundrels of Northern Di
intended to harm the Duke,

12:07.240 --> 12:08.879
so the Crown Prince
rushed to assist him.

12:09.312 --> 12:10.672
Please do not worry, Your Highness.

12:10.799 --> 12:12.080
They were just a disorderly mob.

12:12.080 --> 12:13.184
It's not worth mentioning.

12:13.232 --> 12:14.992
My father is a veteran
of the battlefield.

12:15.039 --> 12:16.159
If they were just a mob,

12:16.176 --> 12:17.720
would it require Crown Prince to go?

12:17.720 --> 12:18.960
According to Tian Yuan,

12:18.960 --> 12:20.000
the Crown Prince thought

12:20.000 --> 12:21.536
this was a good opportunity to show off

12:21.552 --> 12:22.880
in front of his father-in-law.

12:25.360 --> 12:27.279
The Crown Prince is thick-skinned.

12:27.312 --> 12:29.088
Knowing I want to break the engagement,

12:29.120 --> 12:31.152
he still calls
my father his father-in-law.

12:54.200 --> 12:56.039
Standing out here
despite the bitter cold,

12:57.056 --> 12:58.600
is Your Highness trying to show off

12:58.759 --> 13:00.240
your newly acquired cloak?

13:03.240 --> 13:05.559
My father-in-law pitied my frail health,

13:05.968 --> 13:08.240
so he specially gifted me
this cloak to ward off the cold.

13:11.240 --> 13:12.679
I heard you helped my father

13:12.679 --> 13:14.039
repel the ambush from Northern Di.

13:14.064 --> 13:15.710
Fathers and sons
fight together on the battlefield.

13:15.720 --> 13:18.240
A father and son-in-law
joining forces counts as the same.

13:18.519 --> 13:20.480
I make all the decisions
regarding my own affairs.

13:21.159 --> 13:23.559
Even if you do everything
to please my father and brother,

13:23.799 --> 13:24.559
it's useless.

13:25.919 --> 13:26.759
What a coincidence.

13:27.664 --> 13:30.240
I don't care for arranged
marriages by parental command either.

13:30.639 --> 13:32.399
All I want is your heart.

13:33.720 --> 13:35.000
It is really warm to wear,

13:35.000 --> 13:36.080
and the size is just right.

13:37.159 --> 13:38.159
I shall take my leave.

13:41.328 --> 13:43.360
My grandmother
is hosting a banquet tomorrow,

13:43.360 --> 13:44.720
so I will get to see you again.

13:59.320 --> 14:01.879
Hit to eat.

14:19.536 --> 14:21.270
Father has already decreed our marriage.

14:21.879 --> 14:22.720
We are now

14:23.080 --> 14:24.399
an engaged couple.

14:51.559 --> 14:52.480
Let me try.

15:10.320 --> 15:12.759
Hit to eat.

15:16.960 --> 15:17.720
I'll try, too.

15:37.600 --> 15:40.000
Hit to eat.

16:07.919 --> 16:10.639
The Chief Imperial Physician
examined the powder

16:11.120 --> 16:12.879
and found that it
contained an extra herb

16:13.200 --> 16:15.639
that accelerates blood circulation.

16:16.480 --> 16:17.799
When normal people eat it,

16:18.039 --> 16:21.000
their mood instantly becomes cheerful.

16:21.296 --> 16:23.150
This was originally
meant to add to the fun.

16:23.159 --> 16:24.559
It's all because of my frail health

16:25.120 --> 16:26.279
that you were alarmed,

16:26.759 --> 16:28.639
spoiling the fun for my brothers.

16:29.240 --> 16:30.240
Not at all.

16:30.360 --> 16:32.440
Huayong, you mustn't overthink this.

16:37.320 --> 16:38.960
If you feel bored,

16:38.960 --> 16:41.840
I will stay here to keep
you company while you study.

16:41.919 --> 16:43.279
Father, you have to manage affairs.

16:43.472 --> 16:45.120
How can you stay with me all the time?

16:49.360 --> 16:50.960
I would like to have...

16:56.559 --> 16:57.720
Zhaoning.

17:01.080 --> 17:02.399
I understand everything

17:02.399 --> 17:03.840
that is on your mind, Huayong.

17:04.119 --> 17:08.279
I will summon Commandery Princess
Zhaoning to the palace now.

17:08.960 --> 17:09.880
Thank you, Father.

17:11.119 --> 17:11.599
Come.

17:16.740 --> 17:19.220
(East Palace)

17:28.920 --> 17:30.200
Greetings, Crown Prince.

17:30.640 --> 17:32.000
Without consulting you first,

17:32.720 --> 17:33.640
I requested a decree

17:34.128 --> 17:36.160
to bring you to the East Palace
to keep me company.

17:36.400 --> 17:37.440
Are you angry with me?

17:37.720 --> 17:39.039
I come from a family of soldiers,

17:39.799 --> 17:41.000
so my manners are boisterous.

17:41.264 --> 17:43.160
I only fear I might disturb you,
Crown Prince.

17:43.280 --> 17:44.160
It doesn't matter.

17:44.960 --> 17:46.000
I like it lively.

17:46.110 --> 17:48.064
So you are taking
advantage of our engagement,

17:48.200 --> 17:49.319
acting without fear.

17:49.759 --> 17:50.640
Naturally.

17:51.424 --> 17:53.030
I am the one with the official title.

17:53.136 --> 17:54.550
Why shouldn't I act without fear?

17:54.640 --> 17:55.240
I'm not stupid.

17:59.480 --> 18:01.160
I have suffered such a severe injury,

18:01.519 --> 18:02.599
yet you

18:03.240 --> 18:04.640
are so cold to me, my betrothed.

18:05.279 --> 18:06.880
Xihe, can't you treat me a bit better?

18:07.079 --> 18:09.640
How do you want
me to treat you well, Your Highness?

18:13.400 --> 18:14.759
I want to eat the wontons you make.

18:24.960 --> 18:25.960
The wontons are ready.

18:25.968 --> 18:27.200
Please enjoy, Your Highness.

18:27.440 --> 18:28.400
I will take my leave.

18:29.319 --> 18:32.000
His Majesty has arrived!

18:35.160 --> 18:36.200
Greetings, Your Majesty.

18:37.680 --> 18:38.640
Rise.

18:40.039 --> 18:41.160
These wontons

18:41.359 --> 18:43.400
were all handmade by
Commandery Princess Zhaoning?

18:44.839 --> 18:45.480
Indeed.

18:46.640 --> 18:49.039
The wontons made by
Xihe are unique in the palace.

18:49.104 --> 18:51.200
I specially invited you here
to try them, Father.

18:52.279 --> 18:53.119
Very well.

18:58.528 --> 19:01.152
Commandery Princess, your
culinary skills are indeed excellent.

19:01.440 --> 19:02.720
The filling is delicious,

19:02.720 --> 19:04.799
and the soup
is exceptionally rich and fragrant.

19:04.800 --> 19:06.288
You flatter me, Your Majesty.

19:12.160 --> 19:13.000
Useless!

19:14.160 --> 19:16.000
Can you not even serve a meal properly?

19:17.240 --> 19:17.839
Dismissed.

19:17.960 --> 19:18.440
Yes.

19:20.319 --> 19:21.880
Crown Prince, let me...

19:21.880 --> 19:22.559
I will do it.

19:25.240 --> 19:25.880
Alright.

19:39.079 --> 19:40.920
You really know
how to look after people.

19:41.559 --> 19:42.839
For the next few days,

19:43.039 --> 19:45.720
I shall entrust Huayong to your care.

19:46.976 --> 19:48.336
With your trust, Your Majesty,

19:48.440 --> 19:49.880
I will not fail your expectations.

19:56.440 --> 19:58.480
No one has ever been
like the Crown Prince,

19:58.480 --> 20:00.752
who can make Your Highness
angry with just a few words.

20:00.960 --> 20:02.799
I think there is
nothing wrong with this.

20:03.100 --> 20:03.990
What is good about it?

20:04.112 --> 20:05.790
He only knows how
to dig pits for others,

20:05.800 --> 20:07.360
and he has a bunch of twisted arguments.

20:07.376 --> 20:08.352
Where is the good part?

20:08.359 --> 20:09.440
If it were anyone else,

20:09.440 --> 20:10.839
Your Highness wouldn't be angry.

20:11.160 --> 20:12.480
But in front of the Crown Prince,

20:12.480 --> 20:14.039
Your Highness loses
your temper very easily.

20:14.039 --> 20:15.599
Only in front of those close to us

20:15.599 --> 20:16.799
can we reveal our true nature.

20:16.800 --> 20:18.464
Please wait, Commandery Princess.

20:22.736 --> 20:23.712
Commandery Princess,

20:23.839 --> 20:25.039
I have some matters

20:25.160 --> 20:26.440
I wish to speak with you alone.

20:32.320 --> 20:33.110
Commandery Princess,

20:33.359 --> 20:35.920
actually, these words have been
held in my heart for a long time.

20:36.319 --> 20:38.200
But the Crown Prince
never allowed me to speak.

20:38.759 --> 20:39.759
But I feel

20:40.119 --> 20:41.200
that if you do not know,

20:41.400 --> 20:42.839
it is too unfair to him.

20:43.440 --> 20:45.310
Regarding helping
the Duke of Wei this time,

20:45.599 --> 20:47.240
he spoke of it lightly,

20:47.680 --> 20:48.519
but in fact,

20:48.520 --> 20:51.220
the Northern Di crossbowmen
coated their arrows with deadly poison.

20:51.480 --> 20:52.440
Once struck by an arrow,

20:52.759 --> 20:54.240
even the deities could not save him.

20:55.319 --> 20:57.540
The Northern Di people also
set many traps on the road.

20:57.960 --> 21:00.599
It was His Highness who accompanied
the Duke of Wei as the vanguard

21:00.680 --> 21:01.880
to clear out those checkpoints.

21:03.400 --> 21:04.039
That day,

21:04.368 --> 21:06.944
you were set up by Princess Pingling
and fell off the cliff.

21:07.400 --> 21:08.559
The Crown Prince already knew

21:08.688 --> 21:11.440
that you agreed to marry him only
because you knew his life was short.

21:11.664 --> 21:13.510
He claimed he wanted
to sever ties with you,

21:13.888 --> 21:15.790
but the moment he
heard you were in danger,

21:15.872 --> 21:18.592
he rushed down the cliff to find
you regardless of his own safety.

21:20.400 --> 21:21.359
Not only that,

21:21.680 --> 21:23.030
for your sake, His Highness

21:23.040 --> 21:25.800
went to the extreme cold region
to find the Extreme Frost Cordyceps.

21:25.824 --> 21:26.656
He fell off a cliff

21:26.736 --> 21:28.510
and remained unconscious
for three nights.

21:29.456 --> 21:31.504
After walking through
the gates of the underworld,

21:32.119 --> 21:34.440
the poison inside his body
became even harder to control.

21:36.119 --> 21:37.839
You see him acting
carefree all day long,

21:38.319 --> 21:39.039
but in truth,

21:39.408 --> 21:42.128
every treatment for the poison
is a thin line between life and death.

21:42.960 --> 21:44.519
This pain of scraping his bones

21:44.944 --> 21:46.510
is something even someone with a mind

21:46.816 --> 21:48.320
as strong as his can hardly bear.

21:50.319 --> 21:52.079
But to stay by your side,

21:52.519 --> 21:54.240
he resolved to endure all the pain,

21:54.680 --> 21:56.880
only hoping that he
could live a little longer.

21:57.664 --> 21:58.590
Commandery Princess,

21:59.039 --> 22:01.599
His Highness has risked
his life for you time and again.

22:01.920 --> 22:02.960
His affection for you,

22:03.344 --> 22:04.880
I have seen it all with my own eyes.

22:06.079 --> 22:07.359
You do not have to love him back,

22:08.160 --> 22:10.200
but his affection for you

22:10.240 --> 22:12.016
is already past the point of no return.

22:14.080 --> 22:15.790
You worry that he has deep calculations,

22:16.640 --> 22:17.680
but what he gives you

22:17.744 --> 22:19.920
has never been
the schemes of the East Palace,

22:20.000 --> 22:22.096
but rather, amidst the foul waves
of the deep palace,

22:22.240 --> 22:24.480
a pure heart that will
never sink to the bottom.

22:24.700 --> 22:27.460
♪You drifted away alone♪

22:27.820 --> 22:32.340
♪Without a single word of goodbye♪

22:33.580 --> 22:36.100
♪Leaving no room to turn back♪

22:36.100 --> 22:40.060
♪I can only stay there forever♪

22:40.060 --> 22:45.340
♪In the coming years, I'll always
remember that year, my graceful lover♪

22:45.700 --> 22:47.900
♪Love hangs on the crest of the waves♪

22:47.900 --> 22:51.900
♪Waiting for regret to swallow me up♪

22:51.920 --> 22:54.080
What is the matter with
the Commandery Princess?

22:54.240 --> 22:56.000
It has been four hours already.

22:56.319 --> 22:58.599
Why hasn't a piece been
played on this weiqi board yet?

23:23.380 --> 23:27.100
(East Palace)

23:37.488 --> 23:39.744
This whole box of northern pearls
has been gathered.

23:40.160 --> 23:42.640
It was meant to be used for
Xihe's bridal phoenix crown.

23:49.319 --> 23:50.039
Your Highness,

23:50.040 --> 23:51.776
Commandery Princess Zhaoning is here.

23:57.359 --> 23:59.039
Quick, help me up.

24:33.488 --> 24:35.000
Your Highness, pretending to be weak

24:35.040 --> 24:37.140
is something you are
getting increasingly adept at.

24:43.839 --> 24:45.200
Today is the first time

24:45.984 --> 24:47.744
you have come to see me
of your own accord.

24:47.760 --> 24:49.520
His Majesty ordered
me to take care of you.

24:51.079 --> 24:52.319
Sharing a room every day

24:53.240 --> 24:54.319
with me, who is so elegant

24:54.759 --> 24:58.799
and graceful, doesn't it please you,
Commandery Princess?

24:58.800 --> 25:00.400
Your act is so improper, Your Highness,

25:00.416 --> 25:01.648
that I shall take my leave now.

25:06.440 --> 25:07.880
If you leave today,

25:07.968 --> 25:09.680
I will fall into a coma again tomorrow,

25:09.744 --> 25:12.224
and you will still have to come
to the East Palace to see me.

25:24.640 --> 25:26.144
Rest assured, Commandery Princess.

25:26.839 --> 25:27.839
I will not offend you.

25:28.336 --> 25:30.400
Your Highness,
you are well-read in the classics,

25:30.480 --> 25:32.352
yet you don't even
know what an offense is.

25:34.920 --> 25:36.119
I only regret now

25:36.160 --> 25:38.192
that I didn't practice
martial arts in my youth.

25:38.208 --> 25:40.370
If I had the martial skills
of my father and brother,

25:40.576 --> 25:42.070
I would teach you a good lesson.

25:43.820 --> 25:50.500
♪It all returns to your fragrance,
unchanging through the seasons♪

25:50.900 --> 25:53.940
♪Like a flower in the mirror,
like a passing dream♪

25:54.500 --> 25:57.900
♪Even drifting with the flowing water,
I will stay with you♪

25:57.900 --> 26:00.220
♪The one who seeks the fragrance
gets the most intoxicated♪

26:00.220 --> 26:04.660
♪And intoxication
perturbs the heart the most♪

26:05.599 --> 26:06.279
Don't rush.

26:06.920 --> 26:07.519
Let me do it.

26:07.740 --> 26:12.420
♪I only want to
become a couple with you♪

26:12.780 --> 26:14.940
♪No matter how
winding the road ahead is♪

26:14.940 --> 26:19.140
♪We are worth it.
We won't hesitate or retreat♪

26:19.140 --> 26:20.940
♪It is us♪

26:20.940 --> 26:24.260
♪The breeze blows,
and the flowers bloom♪

26:24.260 --> 26:27.300
♪How could we not be a perfect match?♪

26:27.300 --> 26:31.380
♪Cleaving the waves just to experience♪

26:31.380 --> 26:34.700
♪Embracing the flower bud♪

26:35.820 --> 26:39.020
♪When breaking through
the heavy encirclement♪

26:40.740 --> 26:44.980
♪The wind blows gently once again♪

26:44.980 --> 26:47.088
Your heart is beating so fast,
Commandery Princess.

27:02.839 --> 27:03.440
Young Master.

27:04.079 --> 27:04.799
Young Master,

27:04.800 --> 27:06.910
someone went to
Court of Judicial Review to sue you.

27:06.920 --> 27:08.830
Vice Minister Cui has sent some men over

27:08.848 --> 27:10.590
to ask you to assist
with the investigation.

27:20.559 --> 27:22.079
Sir, the man has been brought here.

27:22.359 --> 27:22.920
Dismissed.

27:22.944 --> 27:24.272
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

27:27.480 --> 27:28.960
What kind of crime did I commit

27:28.960 --> 27:30.319
for you to make such a big fuss

27:30.320 --> 27:32.288
and send people
to arrest me at my residence?

27:33.216 --> 27:34.350
This is an official document,

27:34.559 --> 27:35.480
with proper procedures.

27:35.559 --> 27:37.100
Even imperial relatives must cooperate.

27:37.119 --> 27:38.799
No refusal or ignoring is allowed.

27:38.800 --> 27:41.088
Otherwise, it is obstructing justice
and defying the law.

27:41.519 --> 27:42.480
If you dare to flee,

27:42.624 --> 27:44.310
that would be a crime
of resisting arrest.

27:45.279 --> 27:46.200
Fine.

27:50.240 --> 27:50.720
Come on,

27:51.559 --> 27:52.319
tell me.

27:52.400 --> 27:53.759
What crime did I commit,

27:53.760 --> 27:55.328
and what did they accuse me of?

27:58.559 --> 27:59.680
On the tenth of last month,

27:59.839 --> 28:01.880
you harassed a lady
at Wanqing Restaurant,

28:01.880 --> 28:02.599
spoke insolently,

28:02.599 --> 28:04.880
and even claimed you would
take her back to be your wife.

28:04.928 --> 28:05.920
Did you or did you not?

28:06.359 --> 28:08.079
That was just a joke from me.

28:08.480 --> 28:08.920
Good.

28:10.240 --> 28:11.504
On the third of this month,

28:11.519 --> 28:12.960
you gathered with a group of playboys

28:12.960 --> 28:14.079
to feast at Ningxiang Garden.

28:14.079 --> 28:15.559
A single table of food
and liquor cost fifty taels.

28:15.559 --> 28:17.599
You all got drunk and left
without paying the bill.

28:17.600 --> 28:18.592
Did you or did you not?

28:19.519 --> 28:20.000
Furthermore,

28:20.880 --> 28:22.200
ten nights ago at the hour of Hai,

28:22.200 --> 28:23.079
while on an official boat,

28:23.079 --> 28:25.079
you snatched someone's crickets
and fighting roosters for no reason...

28:25.080 --> 28:25.728
Wait a minute.

28:28.400 --> 28:29.359
Tell me the truth.

28:29.839 --> 28:30.720
Did you dig up

28:30.720 --> 28:32.200
these old accounts?

28:32.200 --> 28:33.039
Aside from you,

28:33.264 --> 28:35.870
who else could instigate them
to file these complaints against me?

28:36.440 --> 28:37.440
What do you want?

28:38.320 --> 28:40.320
You won't let me visit
you at the Marquis's Manor.

28:40.448 --> 28:42.176
Yet, I want to see you every single day,

28:42.192 --> 28:44.176
so I had no choice
but to resort to this.

28:51.319 --> 28:51.960
I was wrong.

28:52.880 --> 28:54.200
Vice Minister Cui, Master Cui,

28:54.359 --> 28:55.640
I really know I was wrong.

28:55.640 --> 28:57.000
Please let me go, okay?

28:59.480 --> 29:00.200
Sure.

29:01.079 --> 29:01.960
But

29:02.272 --> 29:03.960
you must let me visit you at your manor.

29:05.319 --> 29:06.440
Isn't that just the same?

29:06.510 --> 29:07.968
You're still going to pester me.

29:09.296 --> 29:10.440
If you don't let me leave,

29:10.440 --> 29:11.640
I'll go on a hunger strike.

29:12.119 --> 29:12.640
Fine.

29:13.599 --> 29:15.359
When you're too weak to feed yourself,

29:15.360 --> 29:16.704
I'll feed you with my own hands.

29:19.200 --> 29:21.110
Then I'll turn
the Court of Judicial Review

29:21.319 --> 29:22.680
upside down!

29:27.140 --> 29:30.700
(East Palace)

29:31.240 --> 29:31.799
Your Highness,

29:31.824 --> 29:33.664
word came from
the Imperial Medical Office

29:33.680 --> 29:36.000
that Director Xue Heng
of the Secretariat is gravely ill.

29:36.440 --> 29:37.240
I'm afraid

29:38.000 --> 29:39.039
his days are numbered.

29:39.400 --> 29:40.680
If Director Xue passes away,

29:41.119 --> 29:43.519
it will cause a massive uproar in court.

29:43.880 --> 29:46.079
Wang Zheng has long
been winning over key officials,

29:46.079 --> 29:47.400
hoping to promote his own people.

29:48.799 --> 29:50.000
He is highly calculating.

29:50.599 --> 29:51.960
Given how hard he's scheming,

29:52.640 --> 29:53.400
it seems

29:53.880 --> 29:55.200
he is determined to take

29:55.232 --> 29:57.056
the position of
Director of the Secretariat.

29:57.680 --> 29:58.720
When a cat catches a mouse,

29:59.680 --> 30:01.119
since when does the mouse have a say?

30:02.592 --> 30:05.160
Go invite Tao Zhuanxian to
the East Palace for a discussion.

30:08.240 --> 30:09.599
I wonder,

30:10.160 --> 30:14.200
why has Your Highness summoned me today?

30:14.839 --> 30:16.759
This tea brewed with fresh milk

30:17.079 --> 30:19.079
can dispel the chill with just one sip.

30:19.079 --> 30:20.839
Thank you, Crown Prince.

30:21.160 --> 30:21.799
Have a taste.

30:33.759 --> 30:35.640
See if you like it, Minister Tao.

30:41.680 --> 30:43.839
White as snow from the Xing kiln,

30:46.640 --> 30:48.039
thin and lustrous.

30:49.000 --> 30:50.519
What a fine tea bowl.

30:50.519 --> 30:51.990
You are an expert in the art of tea.

30:52.079 --> 30:53.400
Gifting this to you

30:53.400 --> 30:54.688
ensures its value isn't wasted.

30:57.480 --> 30:59.680
Did you have me come all this way

31:00.519 --> 31:02.279
just to give me a gift?

31:03.712 --> 31:04.880
There is indeed one matter

31:05.248 --> 31:06.880
I wish to give you a heads-up about.

31:09.119 --> 31:10.039
Minister Xue

31:10.920 --> 31:12.319
might not be in good health.

31:15.119 --> 31:16.519
Have you ever thought about

31:16.864 --> 31:18.030
joining the Three Departments?

31:18.559 --> 31:20.160
Your Highness,

31:21.599 --> 31:24.079
are you trying to
plan a promotion for me?

31:27.720 --> 31:30.279
Thank you for your support,
Crown Prince.

31:30.400 --> 31:33.279
But you and Xihe are about to wed.

31:33.880 --> 31:37.400
If I seek a key position now,

31:38.559 --> 31:41.039
it will invite gossip.

31:41.880 --> 31:44.000
This must not be done.

31:46.480 --> 31:47.440
In terms of seniority,

31:48.160 --> 31:50.279
you have been an official
in the capital for decades.

31:50.528 --> 31:51.550
In terms of achievements,

31:52.119 --> 31:54.279
you have helped
crack several major cases.

31:54.799 --> 31:55.599
In terms of duty,

31:56.079 --> 31:57.640
you rank just below the Six Ministries.

31:57.760 --> 31:59.200
The Ministers of the Six Ministries

31:59.359 --> 32:00.640
have all just newly taken office,

32:00.640 --> 32:02.680
so promoting them
again would be improper.

32:02.920 --> 32:03.480
Thus, you

32:04.319 --> 32:05.640
are the best candidate.

32:06.960 --> 32:07.640
I...

32:07.839 --> 32:09.799
You are a man of capability,
Minister Tao.

32:10.384 --> 32:11.920
It's just that you are upright,

32:11.930 --> 32:13.670
and the Tao family
is not a powerful clan.

32:13.680 --> 32:14.799
Without anyone's help,

32:15.039 --> 32:16.680
reaching the third rank as Grand Censor

32:16.680 --> 32:17.559
would be your limit.

32:18.544 --> 32:20.070
You disdain political maneuvering,

32:20.480 --> 32:21.559
but that doesn't mean

32:21.839 --> 32:22.720
you have no ambition.

32:24.720 --> 32:25.599
Furthermore,

32:26.720 --> 32:27.799
your granddaughter

32:28.000 --> 32:29.590
is about to become the Crown Princess.

32:30.519 --> 32:32.759
You must want to have greater power

32:33.880 --> 32:35.440
to protect Xihe more, right?

32:37.160 --> 32:40.000
After decades of
drifting in the political sea,

32:41.319 --> 32:45.480
you have seen right through me
at a single glance, Crown Prince.

32:48.440 --> 32:49.400
We are all family.

32:49.520 --> 32:51.248
Whether for public or personal reasons,

32:51.440 --> 32:52.519
I ask you, Minister Tao,

32:53.079 --> 32:54.200
to fight for this future.

33:07.350 --> 33:08.976
Director Tao of the Secretariat is here.

33:10.319 --> 33:12.000
Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

33:12.000 --> 33:13.079
The joy is shared by us all.

33:13.079 --> 33:14.599
- Please support us, Director Tao.
- Please support us, Director Tao.

33:14.599 --> 33:16.039
The joy belongs to everyone.

33:16.319 --> 33:17.240
Congratulations to all.

33:19.279 --> 33:21.039
The joy belongs to everyone.

33:22.912 --> 33:25.350
Director Tao, I hope you will support
us more in the future.

33:25.359 --> 33:26.279
Indeed, Director Tao.

33:26.352 --> 33:27.790
Right after Minister Xue resigned,

33:28.039 --> 33:29.160
the rest of us

33:29.160 --> 33:32.119
hadn't even had time to vie for
the position of Secretariat Director,

33:32.480 --> 33:34.200
yet His Majesty
already issued the decree

33:34.519 --> 33:36.359
appointing Minister Tao to replace him.

33:37.640 --> 33:40.359
I previously thought
Crown Prince wouldn't live long,

33:40.640 --> 33:43.359
so I didn't let the girls in my house
dream of marrying him.

33:44.720 --> 33:48.000
I can only blame myself
for being so shortsighted.

33:48.000 --> 33:48.680
True.

33:49.584 --> 33:51.000
- Minister Tao.
- Minister Tao.

33:51.000 --> 33:51.616
Look at that.

33:52.200 --> 33:54.240
Congratulations, Minister Tao.

33:54.799 --> 33:56.240
The joy is shared by us all.

34:02.680 --> 34:04.680
Why did Your Highness
help my maternal grandfather

34:04.784 --> 34:06.880
secure the position
of Director of the Secretariat?

34:07.359 --> 34:09.079
To please you,
the future Crown Princess.

34:09.120 --> 34:10.064
Do you believe it?

34:10.272 --> 34:11.800
Aren't you afraid that in the future,

34:11.810 --> 34:14.240
the Duke of Wei and the Tao families
will grow too powerful?

34:15.960 --> 34:17.519
You worry that if you and I marry,

34:17.568 --> 34:20.110
we will turn against each other later
over conflicts of interest.

34:20.440 --> 34:21.199
So now,

34:21.639 --> 34:23.000
I am elevating your family

34:23.599 --> 34:24.920
to give you enough leverage

34:25.072 --> 34:26.190
and put your mind at ease.

34:26.720 --> 34:28.230
You're too calculating, Your Highness.

34:28.480 --> 34:29.360
I cannot trust you.

34:29.600 --> 34:31.110
When it comes to my marriage with you,

34:31.599 --> 34:33.119
I don't want any schemes involved.

34:33.840 --> 34:35.199
Strengthening your mother's clan

34:35.200 --> 34:36.912
is a responsibility I ought to take.

34:46.240 --> 34:48.280
Things in the world
are never as easy as you think.

34:49.159 --> 34:50.920
You clearly have
the vision and the courage.

34:51.920 --> 34:53.880
Why won't you just try to believe me?

34:53.880 --> 34:56.128
Because the fate of the Gu family
serves as a warning.

35:01.536 --> 35:03.376
The Shen family
is just like the Gu family.

35:04.159 --> 35:05.079
The higher we stand,

35:05.872 --> 35:07.650
the more it feels
like walking on thin ice.

35:08.480 --> 35:09.719
I won't let the Shen family

35:09.719 --> 35:10.920
become the next Gu family.

35:13.519 --> 35:14.199
Xihe,

35:16.624 --> 35:18.960
I can't promise that everything
will be smooth sailing,

35:20.960 --> 35:21.920
but I can assure you

35:23.408 --> 35:25.070
that no matter how great the danger,

35:26.096 --> 35:27.840
we will share the same mind and heart.

35:29.200 --> 35:30.352
As long as you are here,

35:31.320 --> 35:32.000
I will be here.

35:44.540 --> 35:47.140
(Prince Xin's Manor)

35:58.039 --> 35:58.599
Mother,

35:59.000 --> 36:00.519
how will Father sentence the Gu family?

36:00.880 --> 36:01.559
Qing,

36:01.679 --> 36:03.239
no matter how your father rules,

36:03.239 --> 36:04.199
you must remember

36:04.199 --> 36:05.500
that everything the Gu family did

36:05.519 --> 36:07.119
has nothing to do with you.

36:07.119 --> 36:08.760
Only by cutting ties with the Gu family

36:08.760 --> 36:10.159
can you protect your own title.

36:10.400 --> 36:10.960
Report!

36:13.616 --> 36:14.990
A decree has come from the palace.

36:15.079 --> 36:15.920
The entire Gu clan

36:16.079 --> 36:17.000
is to be executed.

36:18.400 --> 36:19.159
What about Qingzhi?

36:20.000 --> 36:21.079
What about Qingzhi?

36:22.719 --> 36:25.119
Prince Xin's Consort is
the eldest daughter of the Gu family.

36:25.639 --> 36:26.800
She is also on the list.

36:30.624 --> 36:31.360
Your Highness.

36:31.360 --> 36:31.920
Qing.

36:31.920 --> 36:33.280
Your Highness. Your Highness!

36:33.400 --> 36:33.880
No.

36:34.119 --> 36:34.840
Qing.

36:34.840 --> 36:36.000
Qing, calm down.

36:52.320 --> 36:53.280
Father!

36:53.679 --> 36:55.280
(Taiji Hall)
In my memorial today,

36:56.119 --> 36:57.719
from the northern defense maps

36:58.360 --> 36:59.960
to the southern provisions strategy,

37:00.039 --> 37:01.679
every single word proves the loyalty

37:02.176 --> 37:04.280
that the Gu family sons
paid for with their lives.

37:06.000 --> 37:08.039
The Gu family could never be traitors.

37:08.159 --> 37:11.360
Father, I beg you to order
a retrial for this case!

37:18.480 --> 37:20.599
The Gu family could never be traitors.

37:22.679 --> 37:25.239
Father, I beg you to order
a retrial for this case

37:26.559 --> 37:28.199
and clear the Gu family's name.

37:31.559 --> 37:33.519
The Gu family could never be traitors.

37:34.400 --> 37:35.719
Prince Xin,

37:36.840 --> 37:39.039
His Majesty's decree cannot be defied.

37:39.039 --> 37:40.320
You should go back for now.

37:44.920 --> 37:45.360
This...

37:47.519 --> 37:49.800
The Gu family could never be traitors.

37:51.960 --> 37:54.960
Father, I beg you to order
a retrial for this case.

38:05.119 --> 38:05.920
Father!

38:09.679 --> 38:10.480
Father,

38:12.079 --> 38:13.119
when I wed Qingzhi,

38:13.400 --> 38:15.199
I made her a promise.

38:18.200 --> 38:19.960
I promised to protect her
for all her life.

38:24.039 --> 38:25.519
I beg you, Father,

38:27.280 --> 38:29.239
do not separate me from Qingzhi.

38:30.920 --> 38:31.719
Changqing,

38:32.679 --> 38:34.239
how can everything in this world

38:35.119 --> 38:38.599
always go as you wish?

38:46.199 --> 38:46.960
I am...

38:49.519 --> 38:50.960
willing to trade my life for hers.

38:53.840 --> 38:54.719
Changqing,

38:55.599 --> 38:56.639
do you

38:56.920 --> 38:59.840
want to die for
the daughter of a traitor?

39:02.159 --> 39:03.079
I am

39:03.559 --> 39:05.280
willing to trade my life for hers!

39:15.000 --> 39:15.840
I will

39:16.599 --> 39:17.960
never regret this!

39:34.039 --> 39:36.239
The Gu family could never be traitors.

39:39.320 --> 39:42.280
Father, I beg you to order
a retrial for this case

39:44.280 --> 39:46.159
and clear the Gu family's name.

39:48.960 --> 39:51.039
An imperial decree has arrived!

40:07.000 --> 40:07.719
Come.

40:09.320 --> 40:11.000
Your Highness, what are your orders?

40:13.936 --> 40:16.000
On the anniversary of
Prince Xin's Consort's death,

40:17.920 --> 40:19.719
you must invite
Commandery Princess Zhaoning

40:23.119 --> 40:24.280
to pay respects with me.

40:25.168 --> 40:26.224
Yes, Your Highness.

40:34.784 --> 40:36.192
I heard that many noble ladies

40:36.208 --> 40:38.150
were summoned to the palace
by Her Majesty today.

40:38.400 --> 40:40.752
She probably wants
them to brainstorm ideas

40:40.800 --> 40:42.960
to make the Spring Banquet
more interesting.

40:42.960 --> 40:45.088
On the surface,
this Spring Banquet is a family feast,

40:45.136 --> 40:47.670
but it's for the imperial family
to observe the young ladies.

40:47.679 --> 40:50.020
These ladies are either
descendants of meritorious officials

40:50.032 --> 40:52.144
or daughters of ministers
of the third rank or above.

40:52.190 --> 40:54.000
They are all carefully
selected candidates

40:54.032 --> 40:56.416
to be the Grand Empress Dowager's
granddaughters-in-law.

40:57.199 --> 40:58.840
Zhen Zhu, you are really improving.

40:59.120 --> 41:00.360
You understand the affairs

41:00.360 --> 41:01.679
of the palace better and better.

41:02.400 --> 41:04.480
Having followed you into
the palace so many times,

41:04.480 --> 41:06.199
no matter what happens,

41:06.199 --> 41:07.599
nothing can escape my ears.

41:14.519 --> 41:16.039
Greetings, Your Majesty.

41:16.896 --> 41:18.030
No need for formalities.

41:18.159 --> 41:20.159
Come, sit next to me.

41:29.639 --> 41:32.800
We were just discussing
the Spring Banquet.

41:32.800 --> 41:34.239
I suddenly have an idea.

41:35.079 --> 41:36.679
How about you organize

41:36.679 --> 41:38.079
next year's Spring Banquet?

41:38.519 --> 41:39.400
What do you think?

41:41.400 --> 41:42.280
Grandmother,

41:42.679 --> 41:43.559
palace banquets

41:43.560 --> 41:45.664
should only be organized
by people from the palace.

41:45.680 --> 41:47.670
The Spring Banquet is
especially in the spotlight.

41:47.744 --> 41:50.230
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
is not yet the Crown Princess.

41:50.320 --> 41:52.420
How could she have
the right to overstep and do this?

41:52.440 --> 41:54.719
His Majesty's marriage decree
was issued long ago.

41:54.880 --> 41:56.239
We will be family sooner or later.

41:56.239 --> 41:57.760
Why draw such a clear line?

41:57.960 --> 41:58.360
You...

42:00.639 --> 42:01.440
Zhaoning,

42:01.559 --> 42:03.119
what is your thought on this?

42:03.424 --> 42:05.070
Thank you for your favor, Your Majesty.

42:05.519 --> 42:08.559
However, I have never
managed such a grand feast before.

42:08.864 --> 42:10.360
I am afraid I might not do it well

42:10.639 --> 42:12.000
and spoil your high spirits.

42:14.159 --> 42:16.840
You are smart and quick to learn.

42:16.960 --> 42:19.599
It is just a family banquet.

42:19.800 --> 42:21.119
Moreover, I appointed you myself.

42:21.280 --> 42:24.039
Even if something goes slightly wrong,

42:24.039 --> 42:26.960
they will not criticize you for it.

42:32.280 --> 42:34.639
I have not yet officially
married the Crown Prince.

42:34.832 --> 42:36.480
One should only act within one's role.

42:36.960 --> 42:38.599
I hope you can understand, Your Majesty.

42:40.320 --> 42:41.199
Very well.

42:42.119 --> 42:42.840
Sit here.

42:44.800 --> 42:46.760
She refused to organize
the Spring Banquet.

42:46.832 --> 42:48.576
Could there be a change in the marriage?

42:49.440 --> 42:50.320
Alright,

42:50.320 --> 42:51.920
once you are married,

42:52.159 --> 42:54.599
let's see where else you can hide.

42:55.472 --> 42:57.110
The noble ladies have carefully prepared

42:57.119 --> 42:58.480
prizes for the Spring Banquet.

42:58.630 --> 43:00.688
Please take a look and select them,
Grandmother.

43:00.960 --> 43:01.719
Good.

43:01.840 --> 43:03.400
Bring them forward.

43:03.559 --> 43:07.039
Let me see what
novelties we have this year.

43:09.519 --> 43:11.360
Your Highness, where are we going now?

43:11.500 --> 43:12.440
To Prince Xin's Manor.

43:12.679 --> 43:14.960
Since Prince Xin is being so persistent,

43:14.960 --> 43:16.700
do you still want to see him,
Your Highness?

43:16.752 --> 43:19.120
This time, he used
the anniversary of Gu Qingzhi's death

43:19.130 --> 43:21.104
to send an invitation
for me to join the memorial.

43:21.159 --> 43:22.199
He calculated

43:22.199 --> 43:23.639
that I'd have no reason to refuse.

43:24.239 --> 43:26.079
Things must be resolved one by one.

43:41.159 --> 43:42.440
Every single word I say,

43:42.679 --> 43:43.960
you know exactly what it means.

43:44.039 --> 43:45.360
You are Gu Qingzhi,

43:45.760 --> 43:46.400
aren't you?

43:46.559 --> 43:48.400
That is why you climb up desperately,

43:48.559 --> 43:51.239
and you will clear every single
obstacle you face away one by one.

43:51.552 --> 43:52.920
And that includes the Gu family.

43:53.079 --> 43:53.960
I was wrong.

43:54.320 --> 43:55.360
Give me one more chance.

43:55.880 --> 43:56.920
I will fight with my life

43:57.519 --> 43:58.559
to keep you safe.

44:03.470 --> 44:06.410
♪I've hidden so many words♪

44:07.030 --> 44:09.830
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

44:10.700 --> 44:17.670
♪So never uncover♪

44:17.860 --> 44:20.220
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

44:21.350 --> 44:24.080
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

44:25.040 --> 44:30.380
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

44:32.140 --> 44:34.960
♪Every answer I gave♪

44:35.760 --> 44:38.610
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

44:39.400 --> 44:42.770
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

44:43.030 --> 44:46.340
♪How hard it truly was?♪

44:49.310 --> 44:52.750
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

44:53.740 --> 44:56.070
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

44:57.340 --> 45:03.100
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

45:04.510 --> 45:07.640
♪It's a shame I never could♪

45:08.090 --> 45:11.100
♪Give you a moon in return♪

45:11.210 --> 45:17.850
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

45:17.850 --> 45:21.520
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

45:22.390 --> 45:25.150
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

45:25.590 --> 45:28.720
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

45:29.160 --> 45:35.110
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

45:36.510 --> 45:40.060
♪You'll never♪

45:40.340 --> 45:49.810
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

46:15.980 --> 46:19.460
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
